# Source 3D art. ocf3dshark.stl alone is ~156 MB; git would keep that blob in
# history forever. The web-ready model IS committed (public/models/shark.glb,
# ~339 KB, plus its shark.json bounds sidecar), and `npm run model` rebuilds
# it from ocf3dshark-flat.stl via scripts/stl-to-glb.mjs. Use Git LFS if the
# raw STL ever needs to be versioned.
